            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The west wing of the Cecil H. Green Library comprises the original Stanford University Library designed by architects Bakewell and Brown and completed in 1919. It sustained considerable damage during the 1989 Loma Prieta earthquake.",
